 "remarks": "Welcome to 64 Gillies Lane, a spacious and beautifully maintained 2-bedroom, 2-bath condominium in the highly sought-after Ledgebrook community. This bright and sunny first-floor unit offers the ease of single-level living with a wonderful open floor plan that's perfect for family time and entertaining. The kitchen flows seamlessly into the spacious living room, where sliding doors lead to a beautiful private patio overlooking the lush grounds, with the pond and pool just beyond-a perfect setting for morning coffee or relaxing at the end of the day. Both bedrooms are generously sized with ample closet space, while two full bathrooms provide added comfort and convenience. Ledgebrook residents enjoy an impressive array of amenities, including a pool, exercise room, walking paths, and approximately 20 acres of beautifully maintained grounds and natural surroundings. The community feels peaceful and tucked away, yet is conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, Metro North, I-95, the Merritt Parkway, and Norwalk's beautiful beaches. Best of all, end your day enjoying a gorgeous sunset overlooking the pool and pond. If you're looking for easy, comfortable living in a terrific Norwalk location, this is one you won't want to miss!",
